     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "After talking to ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "accessLevel": "",
        "id": "5b44cac50a894e589871012b",
        "text": "@Peter Winckles"
       },
       "type": "mention"
      },
      {
       "text": " in Slack, I ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "tree",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "'d the approriate directory and got",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "none"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "root@islandora01:/mnt/fedora-datastreamStore/fcrepo-data/home/data/ocfl-root/8ec/dd3/663/8ecdd3663573ebe4e39e550741f17f1ce781fc33b9fe078cb61400116d928240# tree -a .\n.\n├── 0=ocfl_object_1.0\n├── extensions\n│   └── 0005-mutable-head\n│       ├── head\n│       │   ├── content\n│       │   │   └── r1\n│       │   │       ├── fcr-container.nt\n│       │   │       └── .fcrepo\n│       │   │           └── fcr-root.json\n│       │   ├── inventory.json\n│       │   └── inventory.json.sha512\n│       ├── revisions\n│       │   └── r1\n│       └── root-inventory.json.sha512\n├── inventory.json\n├── inventory.json.sha512\n└── v1\n    ├── inventory.json\n    └── inventory.json.sha512\n\n8 directories, 11 files",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "According to him, it appears to be a bug in the validation code.  It is not accounting for an empty v1 when manual versioning is used.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
